{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/1562966-need-some-1st-ed-help","id":1562966,"title":"Need some 1st Ed help","path":["Home","Onyx Path","Onyx Path Worlds","Scion"],"posts":[{"date":"2026-08-10T10:07:13-07:00","id":1562966,"title":"Need some 1st Ed help","content":"Hey Guys!<br /> Been looking over some of my 1st ed characters, haven't played in years. Anyway, on one of my guys in the Birthrights column is something called,&quot;Behold a Pale Horse&quot;. I remember reading this but can't remember what it does. This is driving me up the wall! Can someone point me to the book this is in? It would be very much appreciated. Thanks!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24598-shadows-and-dust","name":"Shadows and Dust","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"22"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2026-08-15T05:13:45-07:00","id":1563122,"title":"","content":"I'm not finding anything by that name in the actual books. If you used any fan resources or homebrew, there is a purview on the Scion 2.0 fan site called On a Pale Horse (Death <b>\u25cf\u25cf\u25cf\u25cf\u25cf \u25cf\u25cf</b>) that allows the player to strike down five percent of a targeted mortal population. This may or may not be what you're looking for.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/19347-mordred13","name":"Mordred13","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2026-08-16T05:17:34-07:00","id":1563141,"title":"","content":"No that's not it. I remember there was a picture of Erik and his car at the top quarter of the page(I think...it's been awhile) so I thought it had something to do with either movement or a Birthright of some sort. Maybe some kind of improved car cover? <br /> I have all the Onyx published materials soooo yeah, it was probably some fan resource, probably on a website that no longer exists. Either way, thanks for the help! I'll have to keep scratching my shoddy memory and hoping something falls out<img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24598-shadows-and-dust","name":"Shadows and Dust","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"22"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2026-08-25T10:55:01-07:00","id":1563470,"title":"","content":"Scion: God has a picture that might be what you're thinking of on pg. 99. It is around the section on Sky boons, in particular one where you turn into a cloud.<br /> <br /> Anything you can infer about the kind of power it was based on where it is on the character sheet, or the pantheon and tier of the character? Might help narrow down the search.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4270-literatzi","name":"literatzi","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4270_2.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"177"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}